      "writtenOn": "2024-03-13T17:56:24Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Right, this _is_ what I used. However, the protected symbols was ordered differently. I\u0027m not sure why. Done!",
      "parentUuid": "f7e5977f_43c5d4e9",
      "revId": "a10a873b85e6e23c763b62de33557d681127fe07",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": false,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "7a180038_95ce7625",
        "filename": "/PATCHSET_LEVEL",
