        "id": 1889091
      },
      "writtenOn": "2024-03-13T18:03:15Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Symbol list orders them after ignoring any preceding underscores; where as protected exports are sorted based on ASCII. Sorting is not functional requirement in both cases; it\u0027s just readability and ASCII is faster as other requires extra processing. That\u0027s why I chose ASCII for protected symbols.",
      "parentUuid": "cff249b8_36c36a92",
      "revId": "a10a873b85e6e23c763b62de33557d681127fe07",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
